  "body": "Beautiful Arran Hills Home with Granny Potential & Endless Possibilities\r\n\r\nPerfectly positioned in the sought-after Arran Hills community, this exceptional five-bedroom residence offers the ideal blend of luxury, flexibility, and modern family living. Thoughtfully designed over two levels, this beautifully presented home provides generous space for growing families, multi-generational living, or those seeking the perfect work-from-home solution.\r\n\r\nThe upper level is the heart of the home, where light-filled open-plan living seamlessly connects the lounge, dining area, and a stunning designer kitchen. Crafted to impress, the contemporary kitchen features quality finishes, abundant storage, and an effortless flow for everyday living and entertaining.\r\n\r\nThe spacious master suite enjoys its own private ensuite, while two additional bedrooms are serviced by a beautifully appointed family bathroom. From both the master bedroom and living area, step out onto a spectacular hardwood entertaining deck overlooking rolling lawns and beautifully landscaped gardens-an idyllic setting for summer barbecues, morning coffee, or simply relaxing in your own private sanctuary.\r\n\r\nDownstairs offers incredible versatility with two generously sized bedrooms, a modern bathroom, and an open-plan lounge with a convenient kitchenette. Whether you’re accommodating extended family, welcoming long-term guests, creating a private work-from-home space, or giving teenagers their own retreat, this level provides endless possibilities. A spacious double garage is conveniently positioned across the internal passage, completing this well-designed layout.\r\n\r\nThis is a home that effortlessly adapts to your family’s changing needs while delivering style, comfort, and exceptional functionality in one of Orewa’s most desirable new neighbourhoods.\r\n\r\nSpecial Features\r\n\r\n* Five spacious bedrooms and three stylish bathrooms, including a master ensuite.\r\n* Flexible downstairs living with two bedrooms, bathroom, lounge and kitchenette.\r\n* Ideal for extended family, guests, teenagers or work-from-home.\r\n* Designer kitchen with premium appliances and quality finishes.\r\n* Light-filled open-plan living and dining.\r\n* Expansive hardwood entertaining deck.\r\n* Beautiful wraparound lawns and landscaped gardens.\r\n* Spacious master suite opening to the outdoor living area.\r\n* Double internal-access garage.\r\n* Quality construction with modern finishes throughout.\r\n* Peaceful location in the popular Arran Hills community.\r\n* Close to Orewa Beach, excellent schools, parks, cafés, motorway access and all local amenities.\r\n\r\nThis is more than just a home-it’s a lifestyle offering comfort, flexibility, and room for everyone. Opportunities like this are rare, so don’t miss your chance to secure this stunning Arran Hills residence. Arrange your viewing today and experience everything this exceptional home has to offer.",
